 apply=("Apply it: write your code and test it", ["Write five lines in short sentences.", "Name one situation that would test each line.", "Write what you would do about a complaint, who looks into it and how fast.", "Write the date you will review the code.", "Show it to someone you trust and ask what is missing."]),
 act="Write your own five-line code, and name one situation that would test each line.",
